<title>USA: Uniflex Inc president exercises options.</title>
<headline>Uniflex Inc president exercises options.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniflex Inc said on Tuesday that Robert Semel, the company's president and chief operating officer, had exercised 90,000 options to purchase Uniflex common stock.</p>
<p>In a statement, Semel said his investment reflected confidence in the future performance of the packaging products company.</p>
<p>&quot;We are very optimistic that Uniflex will continue to experience strong demand for its products and that the company will achieve its goals for 1997,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
